      "content": "it's not just a storm though. it's like a dead end. i look at my life and i just see a massive pile of mistakes and debt that i can never ever repay. i'm tired of the \"it gets better\" talk. it doesn't get better, it just gets heavier. honestly, part of me feels like the only way to actually stop this cycle and stop being a burden to everyone is to just... not be around. it feels more like the only logical thing to do than to keep pretending there's a way out.",
